## 8. Operational Risk Management

| Risk | Cause | Mitigation Strategy | 
| ----- | ----- | ----- | 
| **D-Wave QPU Timeout / Network Error** | API rate limits or network latency | Fallback seamlessly to D-Wave's local classical annealer (`neal.SimulatedAnnealingSampler()`). Visual UI remains identical. | 
| **C++ Solver Freezes UI** | High node count ($N > 25$) | Wrap C++ binary execution in a Python `subprocess` with a 5-second `timeout` limit. Catch `TimeoutExpired` and display `"COMPUTATIONAL TIME LIMIT EXCEEDED (>30s)"` on dashboard. | 
| **Qiskit Version Incompatibility** | Deprecated `qiskit.execute` methods | Enforce strict usage of `qiskit.primitives.Sampler` and `qiskit_algorithms.optimizers.COBYLA` compatible with Qiskit 1.0+. | 
